#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodgeometrymeshtoolsplugin.rst:23 0dc073248efd4df2b6d5a3936f489915
msgid ""
"FmodGeometryMeshToolsPlugin adds editor actions for selected "
":ref:`MeshInstance3D<class_MeshInstance3D>` nodes. It can create "
":ref:`FmodGeometryInstance3D<class_FmodGeometryInstance3D>` children configured for mesh or "
"collision-shape based FMOD occlusion."
